        "removes MissionPopover.vue / CampaignPopover.vue"
      ],
      "notes": "The only surface. The pill toggles a Mission pane that follows the selected session. Glance: progress bar with the count inside, ONE next step (the rest of what waits on you expands in place), then the tree milestone > step > acceptance criteria. A blocked step opens to its blocker and the unblock action. Ask sends a question to the session. Sessions shows who worked on the mission; the operator alone decides a hand-off. A session with no mission can be attached to one, with confirmation. No kanban, no cross-mission queue."
    }
